          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This site hosts the technical documentation for Antora. Antora makes it easy for tech writers to create documentation and publish it to the web. As a tech writer, you focus on authoring content in "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "AsciiDoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "asciidoc:asciidoc.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", Antora’s content markup language. You organize those files into a standard project structure and store them in one or more content (git) repositories. Antora picks up your content from there and transforms it into a website. That’s all there is to it!"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "With Antora, you manage "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "docs as code"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". That means your documentation process benefits from the same practices used to produce successful software."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Some of these practices include:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Storing content in a version control system."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Separating content, configuration, and presentation."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Leveraging automation for compilation, validation, verification, and publishing."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Reusing shared materials (DRY)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Antora helps you incorporate these practices into your documentation workflow. As a result, your documentation is much easier to manage, maintain, and enhance."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
